Focus is a romance, comedy, crime film directed by Glenn Ficarra.

3
00:14:19,090 --> 00:14:25,090
Nicky, an accomplished con artist, gets romantically involved with
his disciple Jess but later ends their relationship.

4
00:19:05,454 --> 00:19:11,454
Years later, she returns as a femme fatale to spoil his plans.

5
